B.GC=new A.hl("Aretina (1660)","McKenzie wrote 'Aretina', a romantic work often considered the first Scottish novel. It was published in 1660 and showed a very different side to the man who would later become infamous for his cruelty. He was also a prolific essayist and legal writer.")
B.GB=new A.hl("The Advocates Library","McKenzie played a key role in establishing the Advocates Library in 1689, which served as Scotland's leading legal library. It later evolved into the National Library of Scotland, one of the country's most important cultural institutions, housing millions of items.")
